  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> wheel.Spin() / Stop()
    / canUse / State / GetPrize(id) / OnWinIdVariant; WheelFortune.ResolveSectorIndex(...)
    without a scene; WheelMoneyWin.Win(id).\n<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene
    workflow:</b> Select Canvas/WheelFortune: OnWinIdVariant calls Wheel Money Win
    and Demo Controller. [Demo] Services holds Wallet (Money) and the prize table
    (wins).\n<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Play: SPIN, then STOP.
    The sector under the arrow pays its prize; the single-use wheel locks until Re-arm
    wheel.\n<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  SPIN / STOP -> WheelFortune.Spin / Stop
    (prefab buttons)\n<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  Sector labels = WheelMoneyWin.wins:
    the number under the arrow is what you win\n<color=#FA739E>\xBB</color>  Spin
    from code -> Spin(), then Stop() after 1.5 s"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
